    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in most part of the island after 1.00 p.m. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in Central, Sabaragamuwa, Western, Uva, North-western and North-central provinces and in Galle, Matara and Mannar districts.",
